  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Stop idle redraws and keep window resizing responsive.\n- Move existing stock with a single part, or with its named source model, in the same undo step.\n- Keep rotated face and edge picking responsive by skipping unused projections, using linear boundary canonicalization, and caching exact-input projections.\n- Add opt-in projection timing with `CAMCRAFT_PROFILE_PROJECTION=1`.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Manual checks reported: resizing responds normally, stock follows model rotation, and the edge-pick freeze appears resolved.\n- Focused automated tests were added for stock placement, rotated face refusal, boundary canonicalization, and projection cache correctness. They have not all been run in this session.\n\nRefs #164\n",
